{"id":"235759","name":"泡菜","author":"多芸转晴","authorId":"1423192","desc":"","cover":"images/235759/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"兰州包心菜","amount":"1个"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜","amount":"1个"},{"name":"红辣椒","amount":"2个"},{"name":"盐","amount":"3克"},{"name":"糖","amount":"1茶匙"},{"name":"白醋","amount":"1汤匙"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"一定要选这种兰州包心菜，做出来的泡菜才好吃","img":"images/235759/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"包心菜用手一片片撕成小块，千万不要用刀切","img":"images/235759/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"用清水冲洗干净","img":"images/235759/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅里放水稍微汆一下水，不能煮过头了，煮过头的菜泡出来后会不脆","img":"images/235759/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"辣椒，蒜瓣切碎待用","img":"images/235759/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"沥干水的包心菜中放入蒜、辣椒","img":"images/235759/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"一勺盐水糖","img":"images/235759/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"辣椒酱一勺","img":"images/235759/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"最后放入一勺白醋","img":"images/235759/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"搅拌均匀","img":"images/235759/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入密封罐中浸泡一夜","img":"images/235759/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"又脆，又辣，又下饭～","img":"images/235759/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"😍","img":"images/235759/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"😍😍","img":"images/235759/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"😍😍😍","img":"images/235759/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"1.包心菜用手一片片撕成小块，千万不要用刀切\n2.记得等菜放凉了再放醋，那样醋就不容易挥发 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}